      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For other case, if it possible to control when visitor of event can join instance from UI option, would be wonderful.\n\nFor certain event, event start time be just idea and actual event start time often not much exactly. in this case, if user can start event manually like discord can may work better.",
