  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Regarding linked event, there is need of having role perm to allow certain user get into event instance in-advance to allow performer able to ready before event time start.\n\nFor example, there is event which has few performers and instance become full within few minutes when event happen most of case.\n\nIn this case, if performer cannot join off instance in-advance, they may need to wait on the join queue for while before event actually can start.\n\nTo prevent this, if there is way to limit public join off event instance while certain roles can join in-advance to get everything ready.",
